  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>The Grip Comb is a premium hairstyling attachment designed to make the silk press process easier, smoother, and more efficient. It attaches directly to your flat iron to assist with the chase method, helping create sleek, salon-quality results at home. Designed with textured hair in mind, it is heat-resistant up to 500°F, detachable, easy to clean, and comes with both fine and wide tooth comb attachments.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We are not a generic beauty gadget. The Grip Comb was created out of a real styling struggle and built specifically to simplify straightening natural, curly, and coily hair. Our redesigned 2.0 version fits curved and straight irons and is built for durability and performance. This is a functional, problem-solving tool that creators genuinely love demonstrating on camera.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>We offer 15% commission per order with a 30-day tracking cookie. Affiliates receive a custom link and discount code to share with their audience. High-performing partners may be considered for gifting, increased commission tiers, and long-term collaborations.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>We perform best with tutorials, silk press transformations, GRWM styling routines, and honest product demonstrations. Educational and problem-solution content converts especially well. Before-and-after videos are strongly encouraged.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We manually review applications and prioritize creators in the haircare, beauty, and textured hair space with engaged audiences. We are building long-term partnerships, not one-off promo posts.</p></div></div>",
